    "description": "AST-expansion conformance fixture for grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D1x_periodic: a minimal consuming model binding NX=NY=4 at the import edge. The plain match D(u,x) must lower, through the section-9.6.3 fixpoint, to the rule's makearray — interior columns [2,3] (all j) holding the centered x-stencil aggregate, the i=1 and i=4 x-faces holding the periodic-wrap centered differences over the (1 x NY) strips — with all metaparameters folded and the free name dx surviving in the expanded body. The model fulfills the geometry contract with x0=y0=0 and dx=dy=1/4; the dx/dy expressions are spelled with the literal 4 because the edge binding closes NX/NY before this document's scope (grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/grid.esm). The golden pins the byte-identical post-lowering AST across bindings.",
